When monsters are generated some might get scrolls of earth for 
offensive item and scrolls of teleportation or create monster for 
defensive item(1). When you add here that all closests (1 by 1 parts of 
corridor) without doors are generated with a scroll of teleportation, we 
have the situation where scroll of teleportation is most numerous scroll 
generated in the dungeon.

But you have mixed probabilities with statistics. If ?oEW has 
probability of 8% it doesn't mean that 8% of generated scrolls are ?oEW. 
It means that the more we generate scrolls in the game the number of 
?oEW approaches 8% of all scrolls. But in any sequence of scroll 
generations of any size there is non-zero probability that no ?oEW is 
generated.

